						and/or diverse, and your butt is on the line for getting=20
						it all done, somehow, someway-and getting it done on=20
						time-then this is the program. Period.=94 </font></p>
						<p><font size=3D"2">Bob found the =93project blocks=94 feature=20
						of Achieve Planner particularly helpful. Project blocks=20
						allow Bob to schedule time for projects/tasks directly=20
						in the calendar, which helps him plan his days and weeks=20
						in advance. Bob added, =93Transferring a task into a=20
